re when attaching and removing ornaments and avoid positioning them where they could create a trip or entanglement hazard. Retain packaging and product information for future reference. Neo Direct Ltd, Butterley Street, Leeds, LS10 1AW, United Kingdom","productSummary":"Transform your home into a festive wonderland with our stunning Neo Christmas Tree Ornament Decorations. Perfect for Christmas, parties, and even Halloween tree decorations, these dazzling baubles and glitter balls bring sparkle and sophistication to any setting. Whether you're decking the halls or hosting a holiday event, these copper-orange ornaments will elevate your d&eacute;cor with timeless elegance. Add a magical touch to your festive celebrations with these sparkling Christmas ball ornaments. Whether you prefer a traditional, modern, or whimsical theme, our Christmas bauble decorations are designed to make your tree shine brighter than ever. For decorative use only. This product is not a toy. Keep ornaments, hanging strings, hooks and any small components out of reach of young children and pets due to potential choking, ingestion and entanglement hazards. Adult supervision is recommended when children are present. Ensure all decorations are securely attached to the Christmas tree to reduce the risk of items falling. Discontinue use of any ornament that becomes cracked, broken or develops sharp edges. Keep decorations away from open flames, candles, heaters and other direct heat sources. Take care when attaching and removing ornaments and avoid positioning them where they could create a trip or entanglement hazard. Retain packaging and product information for future reference. Neo Direct Ltd, Butterley Street, Leeds, LS10 1AW, United Kingdom","sourceDescriptionAbsent":false,"detailsReady":true,"observedAt":"2026-11-19T00:34:13.489Z","attributeObservedAt":"2026-11-18T19:00:16.862Z","detailEvidence":{"selectedSku":"x9m560bf","sourceParentId":"x9m560bf","sourceUrl":"https://www.argos.co.uk/produc